data/chat-shorthand.tsv lists chat abbreviations and the words they stand for, written by hand.
Which abbreviations to list was decided by counting them in the forum pages of FineWeb-2 vie_Latn
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceFW/fineweb-2), made available by Hugging Face under the
Open Data Commons Attribution License (ODC-By) v1.0; no text of that data set is copied here.

